### Key Constraints Summary

| Constraint Type | Tables | Details |
|-----------------|--------|---------|
| **Primary Keys** | All 22 tables | Auto-increment BIGINT (except composite PKs) |
| **Foreign Keys** | 32 relationships | CASCADE/SET NULL/RESTRICT per semantics |
| **Unique Constraints** | 8 | email, order_number, idempotency_key, user_role_outlet, outlet_weekday, payment_ref, outlet_item, cart_customer |
| **Check Constraints** | 12 | Prices ≥ 0, quantities > 0, weekday 0-6, open<close, min≤max |
| **Indexes** | 25 | FK columns, query patterns (status, created_at, customer_id) |

### Money Storage Convention
- **All monetary values**: `INT` in **paise** (1 INR = 100 paise)
- Columns: `*_minor` suffix (base_price_minor, subtotal_minor, grand_total_minor, etc.)
- **Display**: Divide by 100, format as ₹X.XX
- **Calculation**: Server-side only, integer arithmetic